<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσχήμ-ων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῆμα</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>misshapen, ugly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.624S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unseemly, shameful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				46a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1336b14
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γενέσθαι</span> to be
				<i>indecorous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.160
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσχημονέστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1127b13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					2.12.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				29
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>”
				<i>very meanly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					959d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
